32:51.270 --> 32:52.530
Awak beritahu beliau,

32:53.260 --> 32:56.080
♪ Gunung dan awan terpisah
di timur dan barat ♪

32:54.830 --> 32:55.890
Saya, Xiao Qiushui

32:56.100 --> 33:00.800
♪ Keperwiraan tetap di dalam hati ♪

32:58.480 --> 32:59.940
